  "body": {
    "id": "lem:causal-identification",
    "kind": "lemma",
    "statement": "Let \\(P\\in\\mathcal M_{N,T,\\mathbf n}\\).  Then, for almost every admissible query \\(z_0\\) under its marginal query law,\n\\[\n \\tau(z_0)=\\sum_{s=1}^{S}\\pi_s\\left\\{\n \\mathbb E_P[B_{si}^{\\mathrm{obs}}\\mid z_0]-m_s(z_{0s})\\right\\}.\n\\]\nAt a fixed admissible query, every labelled causal point \\(\\xi=(\\mathbb K_\\xi;\\mu,m,\\Sigma)\\in\\mathcal M_{N,T,\\mathbf n}(z_0)\\) satisfies\n\\[\n \\tau(z_0)=\\theta_{\\mathrm{ker}}(\\xi;z_0)\n =\\sum_{s=1}^{S}\\pi_s\\{\\mu_s-m_s(z_{0s})\\}.\n\\]",
